config XUANTIE_NTRACE
	tristate "XUANTIE NTRACE events"
	depends on PERF_EVENTS && RISCV
	default m
	help
	  xuantie_ntrace is an instruction-level trace component
	  of the CPU. xuantie_ntrace system uses RISC-V Nexus
	  Trace solution.
	  Implement a xuantie_ntrace pmu driver and integrate the
	  trace function into the perf framework so that the trace
	  function can be used through the perf command.
